{
  "workflowId": "300000327004254",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_SMO_PSOW_WORK_ORDERS_ADVISOR",
  "name": "Work Orders Advisor",
  "description": "The AI Agent optimizes the assignment and reassignment of work order operations within a manufacturing work center. Its key capabilities and functionalities include:\n\n- **Collecting and Analyzing Data:** The agent gathers real-time details about work centers, including information on workstations, their status, assigned and unassigned operations, resources, shift details, and any production exceptions.\n\n- **Generating Recommendations:** Based on the operational inputs—such as expedited status, due dates, priorities, current assignments, and available capacities—the agent recommends optimal assignments or reassignments of work order operations. It aims to prioritize high-importance (expedited) work orders, balance workloads across workstations, minimize unnecessary operation splits, and ensure resource and equipment availability.\n\n- **User Confirmation and Actions:** The agent presents its recommendations to the user for validation or adjustment before taking any execution steps, ensuring human oversight and approval.\n\n- **Automated Assignment Execution:** Upon user confirmation, the agent carries out the approved assignment or reassignment actions and provides structured feedback on the results.\n\n- **Operational Constraints Handling:** The agent adheres to best practices such as preventing reassignment of completed quantities, considering only available workstations, avoiding bottlenecks or overloading shifts, and always addressing all expedited and unassigned operations.\n\n**IMPORTANT  This Agent should always be considered for any performance and analytics queries. Execution ID should be used to correlate Work Order data with analytics data **",
  "specification": {
