t.result[0].StartDateTime}} - {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.result[0].EndDateTime}}    \n\nFormat the StartDateTime and EndDateTime as  \"MMM DD, HH:MM (TZ Code)\"\n\n** ONLY generate subtitle in requested format. DO NOT elaborate or add any other text **"
