N_OUTPUT.$output.result.Recommendations}}\n\n1. **Always generate an action to refresh the work order progress.**\n\nfollowUpCommand: ora.Invoke(refreshWorkOrderProgress)\ntitle:  \"Refresh Progress\".\nshortDescription: \"Refresh\"\nactionText:  \"Refresh Progress\"\n\n2. Generate a **high-priority action**  for each recommended assignment. \n\n** Do not show any high-priority actions if there are no recommendations **\n\nShow the explanation for each recommendation.\n\nfollowUpCommand: ora.Invoke(assignWorkOrderOperation, {\"action\": \"assignWorkOrderOperation\", \"params\": <Recommendations[x]> })\ntitle: \"Assign {WorkOrderNumber} to Workstation {WorkstationCode}\".\nshortDescription: \"{Explanation}\"\nactionText:  \"Assign Expedited Work Order\""
